{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Let me reconsider the puzzle. The key constraint is \"translated into over twenty five languages\" — this is a distinctive feature. Let me think about what 2016 book was a contender for the Man Booker International Prize and translated into 25+ languages.\n\nActually, let me reconsider whether the award might be the Man Asian Literary Prize (created 2007, in the 2000s). Let me also reconsider the structure: \"the year in which this book was published, another book...won the very award.\" So Book A published in year X (2010s), and in that same year X, Book B (released the preceding year X-1) won the award.\n\nLet me search for books translated into 25+ languages that were contenders for these prizes.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"novel translated into 26 languages shortlisted Man Asian Literary Prize\", \"book translated into 27 languages contender literary prize 2010s\", \"novel translated into 28 languages shortlisted award 2010s\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_3102f249d0f84f92b6a8b349","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Han Kang born Gwangju\", \"Han Kang birthplace city\"], \"top_k\": 5}","name":"search"},"id":"call_3e39f0a15f2a40569ee9ac1e","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789488124,"id":"chatcmpl-bf5520a5-9717-99a8-b537-e4134a2cb0d1","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":20096,"completion_tokens":247,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":20343,"cached_tokens":3584,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":3584},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}